      "writtenOn": "2020-07-23T15:28:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I still haven\u0027t reviewed this and the next one. But a quick look shows that it is intrusive in some areas. Ideally this kind of change better be protected with a CONFIG option so users who don\u0027t need it can avoid this extra complexity in their code.\n\nI appreciate it won\u0027t be easy but I strongly recommend to consider this when refactoring as Todd suggested as it\u0027ll give an extra incentive knowing that it can be disabled keeping the current behavior/code intact for users that don\u0027t care.",
